1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,340
Ninety-four,

2
00:00:01,340 --> 00:00:01,980
and I just came

3
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:03,319
out of the sea.

4
00:00:03,319 --> 00:00:03,899
Every morning

5
00:00:03,899 --> 00:00:05,339
since I was nine.

6
00:00:05,339 --> 00:00:06,040
Cold?

7
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,059
Of course, it's cold.

8
00:00:07,059 --> 00:00:07,639
It's the sea,

9
00:00:07,639 --> 00:00:09,080
it's not soup.

10
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:10,220
You go in slow,

11
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,580
piano, piano, and you

12
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:12,480
say a bad word.

13
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:15,460
Everybody says the bad word.

14
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:16,839
I go where it's safe.

15
00:00:16,839 --> 00:00:18,160
I never go alone.

16
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:19,519
Today, I have Julia

17
00:00:19,519 --> 00:00:20,300
with the telephone.

18
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:23,100
Useless, but she's here.

19
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,320
The sea doesn't care

20
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:25,120
how old you are.

21
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:26,600
It only cares

22
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,239
that you come.

